#### Questions?

If you have any questions specific to my adaption of SimpleNLG for German,
please feel free to [contact me](mailto:bollmann@linguistics.rub.de).  For
questions about the original SimpleNLG, please refer to the [SimpleNLG
discussion list](http://groups.google.com/group/simplenlg) instead.

Finally, do not hesitate to get in touch with me if you would like to continue
or contribute to the development of this software package (e.g., porting it to
the newer version 4 architecture).  I will do my best to assist you as much as
time allows.
